OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners 'disgusted' by waste
OL,4,Asite plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group says it will fight
OL,7,Fplans to develop a waste management
OL,8,Fsite where residents have complained
OL,9,Fabout bad smells for years.
OL,11,FWastewise, in Willerby, East Yorkshire,
OL,12,Fwants to expand its biowaste facility
OL,13,Fto include different types of waste and
OL,14,Fhas launched a consultation.
OL,16,FElaine Houghton, who lives in
OL,17,FCottingham and runs Stop The Stink,
OL,18,Fdescribed the plans as "horrendous" and
OL,19,Fsaid they would be objecting.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
