OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners 'disgusted' by waste
OL,4,Asite plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for FCC Environment, the
OL,7,Foperator of the site, said the facility
OL,8,Fwas needed to meet the future waste
OL,9,Frequirements of the area.
